<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use – LabelMetric" description="Terms of use and calculation limitations for LabelMetric label printing calculators." canonicalPath={path}>
  <article class="narrow" style="padding:42px 0 64px"><h1>Terms of use</h1><p><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 2026</p><p>LabelMetric provides calculation tools for informational and planning purposes. Results are estimates and can differ from real production because of material variation, winding behavior, equipment settings, manufacturing tolerances and input error.</p><h2>No production guarantee</h2><p>You are responsible for verifying production-critical dimensions, quantities, material compatibility, printer settings, barcodes, safety requirements and commercial specifications with your equipment and material documentation.</p><h2>Availability</h2><p>The service may change as formulas, features and documentation are improved. Before public launch, have the final terms reviewed for the legal requirements that apply to the site's owner and operating jurisdiction.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>
